    "summary": "deleteUnresolvedRowInTxn delegates to the counted removePendingRowInTxn (row, by-file and by-target entries, class and reason counts in one transaction), so deleteUnresolvedForFile / ForRepoFile / ForRepo decrement what they remove; the two promotions already use the counted helper directly, so no removal is counted twice. updateUnresolvedMeta / updateUnresolvedMetaBatch merge meta, clear a stale candidates list on a class other than 'ambiguous', and move the count on a class or reason change. listUnresolvedRelations gains opts.awaiting, read through unresolved_by_target across repositories. Evidence: docs/epics/complete-consistent-richer-code-index-one-E20261011c2ba6fa6/S001/evidence/t4-suites.md (db, indexer, daemon, analyze: 2261 tests, 2154 pass, 0 fail, 104 skipped; three falsifying mutations).",
